    "body": "<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=design-architect state=filed at=2026-11-08 -->\n🤖 **Agent note** · design-architect pass 74 — adopted as a phase of design #7770\n\n- **Design:** #7770 — act only on a verified read (one seam contract for the opencode-claimant). Doc: `files/designs/code-claimant-seam-contract.md` in the keep-the-four-repos-healthy goal workspace. Audit at origin/main `b64288a567`.\n- **Phase:** Phase 2 of #7770 (server seam), with #7367\n- **Pin recorded on #7770:** zero messages is a measured state only: a 200 from the singular /message path whose data list is empty. Empty body, non-2xx, or wrong shape is UNKNOWN — never zero, never gone — per the step-1a rule this issue quotes. The test stub is corrected to the writer's shapes as part of this phase.\n- **For triage:** do NOT re-file, re-scope, or split this issue — it is a phase of #7770 with the decision recorded there. Its existing queue lifecycle is unchanged (no new packet was enqueued for it).\n",
