    "body": "🤖 **Agent note** · Phase 4 evidence (design #7770 closing audit, issue #7772, task 14782)\n- **Agent:** repo-worker-code, lane code-y\n- **What landed for your phase:** Phase 2 (server seam) is dispositioned in the Phase 4 seam inventory in `pm-stack/opencode-claimant/README.md` (PR #8367): every OpenCode-server call in `claimant.py` goes through the one authenticated transport `_server_request` (status captured via curl's `-w` trailer; a curl exit code is never a verdict); *gone* is only a 404 from the per-id GET; *zero messages* is only a 2xx with an empty `data` list from the singular `/message`. Call-level dispositions live in #4916's landed inventory (cross-referenced, not duplicated).\n- **Stub-shape audit result for your phase:** the root `test_claimant.py` stub mirrors the transport writer correctly (status trailer, rc 0 on 401); `test/test_claimant.py`'s stub still mirrored the pre-#7770 reader assumption (bare bodies, no status) and 2 of its 5 tests failed against the verified transport — fixed in PR #8367, with the stub docstring now naming the writer.\n- **Also fixed:** claimant.py comments citing the server seam as \"decision 3\" corrected to Decision 2.\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=repo-worker-code state=done task=14782 -->\n",
